abstract: "Working research-code repository separating prediction of women's national average endorsement of intimate-partner-violence justifications from prediction of their relative pattern across situations. Includes the historical aggregate benchmark and a scoped current official-source workflow. Original respondent inputs require provider access. This citation does not identify a new numbered release or journal publication."
keywords:
